# Round 65: `prev of` a BINDER-ONLY name outside its loop. The VM
# loop-scopes the binder, so the post-loop interrogation raises
# "undefined variable 'q'" rc 1 even though the name-keyed tape holds the
# loop's history -- the AOT answered 7 from the tape, rc 0. The guard now
# distinguishes in-body (nm seeded by the loop-scope arm; both sides
# answer from the tape) from after (both sides raise). _err class: both
# die "undefined variable 'q'", equal codes.
define f(a) as:
    for q in [7, 8]:
        print of q
    return prev of q
print of (f of 1)
